message: "If you use this project, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "resume-screener-lora: a LoRA fine-tuned Qwen2.5-0.5B resume screener with an honest evaluation"
authors:
  - family-names: "Tomar"
    given-names: "Ayush Singh"
repository-code: "https://github.com/ayush-s-tomar/resume-screener-lora"
url: "https://resume-screener-finetune.onrender.com/"
license: MIT
abstract: "A LoRA adapter for Qwen2.5-0.5B that returns a structured JSON verdict for a resume and a target role, evaluated against zero-shot and prompted baselines on 96 held-out synthetic examples. The repository documents its limits, including synthetic labels and a weak result on hand-written resumes."
keywords:
